# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF.
#
# timer_service.py arrived with CRLF from a Windows upload while every other
# file used LF. Mixed endings make diffs noisy and make byte-level comparisons
# (such as verifying the generated _PROJECT_BUNDLE.txt) report false conflicts.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
